2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561387} {:answer/id #uuid "2c7768f2-6413-5fae-8725-57c4bedccb07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "80{\\text{ mm}}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561398} {:answer/id #uuid "3124f5e6-c509-56b8-8bc7-055ff972b970" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "99{\\text{ mm}}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561403} {:answer/id #uuid "856cc125-2c58-5183-80aa-e2a37b30b90c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "50{\\text{ mm}}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561423} {:answer/id #uuid "9c594856-7359-580f-ba95-301b91c5962e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "141{\\text{ mm}}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561430}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "13fa3949-89d4-57d3-8cdf-16c0eb40ce6b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "19{\\text{ mm}}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561387} :answer-field/id #uuid "7f95e495-8770-5e1c-a1e5-a190f92c7426" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186561422}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "bf54d5bd-b74b-5410-8f38-b48a5069f40d" :question/problem "![](images/06/06d308a50c664795dd52ae3be40da7a0c23882fb11ba1d0f8f5d9d29bf1331a1.png)\n\nThe area of $ABCD$ is $61{\\text{ mm}}^{2}.$ What is the area of $△BCD$ rounded to the nearest integer?" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by finding the area of $△ABD.$ We get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{△ABD} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot AB\\cdot AD\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡A \\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 16\\cdot 10\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{90}^{∘} \\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 160\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{90}^{∘} \\\\ & ≈80{\\text{ mm}}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to the nearest integer.\n\nThe difference of the areas of $△ABD$ and the quadrilateral $ABCD$ gives the area of $△BCD.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{△BCD} & ={A}_{△ABD}-{A}_{ABCD} \\\\ & =80-61 \\\\ & =19{\\text{ mm}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Area of a Triangle Given the Area of a Quadrilateral"}]}
